1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:44,905 --> 00:01:45,745
Leyan

3
00:01:50,585 --> 00:01:52,225
Teacher, I've finished the painting.

4
00:01:56,585 --> 00:01:57,785
The brushwork is exquisite.

5
00:01:57,865 --> 00:01:58,785
But…

6
00:01:58,865 --> 00:02:00,505
it lacks a soul.

7
00:02:18,665 --> 00:02:19,905
"Spring Comes Late."

8
00:02:20,625 --> 00:02:22,305
Last night brought word of spring.

9
00:02:22,385 --> 00:02:24,145
My heart rejoices in secret.

10
00:02:24,225 --> 00:02:25,385
My springtime longing is quietly sent.

11
00:02:26,065 --> 00:02:27,505
Only spring knows the affairs of spring.

12
00:02:28,105 --> 00:02:29,265
Is this "Spring Comes Late"?

13
00:02:30,305 --> 00:02:31,625
Since Lingyi passed away,

14
00:02:32,225 --> 00:02:34,665
every day has felt like
walking on thin ice.

15
00:02:34,745 --> 00:02:36,425
The winter has been long,

16
00:02:36,505 --> 00:02:38,305
and spring seems forever out of reach.

17
00:02:38,385 --> 00:02:39,625
But that day,

18
00:02:39,705 --> 00:02:41,385
when I laid down the dagger before you,

19
00:02:43,145 --> 00:02:44,385
I finally came to understand.

20
00:02:47,385 --> 00:02:48,785
The dead are gone.

21
00:02:49,345 --> 00:02:51,865
The living must live for themselves.

22
00:02:53,265 --> 00:02:54,265
Leyan.

23
00:02:54,345 --> 00:02:56,505
You gave me a new life.

24
00:02:57,785 --> 00:02:58,745
From now on,

25
00:02:59,385 --> 00:03:01,185
I want to live for myself once more.

26
00:03:03,225 --> 00:03:04,465
Teacher, if you can think this way,

27
00:03:04,545 --> 00:03:05,545
then nothing could be better.

28
00:03:05,625 --> 00:03:06,825
Some time ago,

29
00:03:06,905 --> 00:03:08,825
when I saw you so grief-stricken,

30
00:03:08,905 --> 00:03:10,745
yet still helping Director Meng
fight corruption,

31
00:03:11,345 --> 00:03:12,905
I admired you deeply,

32
00:03:12,985 --> 00:03:13,865
but worried about you day and night.

33
00:03:15,185 --> 00:03:17,105
So I painted this spring scene

34
00:03:17,185 --> 00:03:18,265
as a gift for you.

35
00:03:25,785 --> 00:03:26,625
Leyan.

36
00:03:27,505 --> 00:03:29,305
All of this is because of you.

37
00:03:29,385 --> 00:03:31,065
Only when I'm beside you

38
00:03:31,145 --> 00:03:32,865
can I truly be myself.

39
00:03:36,185 --> 00:03:37,785
I know teacher and
student have their bounds.

40
00:03:39,385 --> 00:03:41,105
The road ahead will be difficult,

41
00:03:45,145 --> 00:03:46,385
but if I persist…

42
00:03:47,145 --> 00:03:47,985
Leyan.

43
00:03:49,385 --> 00:03:50,585
Would you be willing,

44
00:03:51,505 --> 00:03:52,705
to be brave for me once?

45
00:04:02,505 --> 00:04:04,545
I never understood what love was.

46
00:04:05,665 --> 00:04:07,545
But I saw my parents stand by each other,

47
00:04:08,185 --> 00:04:09,545
supporting one another.

48
00:04:09,625 --> 00:04:11,105
I saw my brother

49
00:04:11,185 --> 00:04:13,345
risk everything to find
medicine for Miss Yan.

50
00:04:15,105 --> 00:04:16,505
And I saw you,

51
00:04:16,585 --> 00:04:17,745
Teacher, broken by grief.

52
00:04:19,145 --> 00:04:20,185
Only then did I understand

53
00:04:21,225 --> 00:04:22,905
that love

54
00:04:22,985 --> 00:04:24,545
can make one face death without regret,

55
00:04:25,385 --> 00:04:26,465
and suffer pain that pierces the heart.

56
00:04:30,145 --> 00:04:32,185
I do not want to be trapped by convention

57
00:04:33,065 --> 00:04:34,545
or bound by old proprieties.

58
00:04:37,705 --> 00:04:40,985
Before, you had a family,

59
00:04:42,745 --> 00:04:43,825
so I dared not cross the line.

60
00:04:48,705 --> 00:04:49,665
But today,

61
00:04:50,865 --> 00:04:52,425
I want to say this boldly.

62
00:04:54,865 --> 00:04:55,785
Teacher,

63
00:04:57,825 --> 00:04:59,345
I also have feelings for you.

64
00:05:05,345 --> 00:05:06,345
This gift…

65
00:05:06,425 --> 00:05:07,665
I prepared it long ago.

66
00:05:08,265 --> 00:05:09,825
Today I can finally give it to you.

67
00:05:17,905 --> 00:05:19,225
It is a Heart-Lock.

68
00:05:19,905 --> 00:05:21,425
The cloud patterns on it

69
00:05:21,505 --> 00:05:24,505
were each drawn by my own hand.

70
00:05:26,065 --> 00:05:27,145
Let this heart be the lock,

71
00:05:27,225 --> 00:05:28,625
and the clear wind be the key.

72
00:05:29,265 --> 00:05:32,105
From now on, seeing this lock
will recall our first resolve.

73
00:05:32,945 --> 00:05:33,985
May we live this life without regret.

74
00:06:01,825 --> 00:06:03,385
I want to protect you for a lifetime.

75
00:06:04,345 --> 00:06:05,385
Would you be willing,

76
00:06:06,905 --> 00:06:07,865
to be brave for me once?

77
00:06:41,385 --> 00:06:43,705
Who are you, barging into my residence?

78
00:06:43,785 --> 00:06:45,305
You have some nerve.

79
00:06:45,385 --> 00:06:48,265
Not as much as you, Right Chancellor.

80
00:06:48,345 --> 00:06:50,105
You raised the Tiger's
Roar Gang as your claws,

81
00:06:50,185 --> 00:06:52,225
and once you'd used them up,

82
00:06:52,305 --> 00:06:54,065
even your own flesh-and-blood brother

83
00:06:54,145 --> 00:06:55,425
was someone you could murder.

84
00:06:58,345 --> 00:07:00,505
A skulking coward like you

85
00:07:01,265 --> 00:07:03,225
dares threaten me with such nonsense?

86
00:07:06,025 --> 00:07:08,705
Every dirty deal you made with Ling Yunfei

87
00:07:08,785 --> 00:07:10,185
is enough to condemn your entire clan.

88
00:07:15,145 --> 00:07:16,545
Who are you?

89
00:07:16,625 --> 00:07:18,065
How do you know so much?

90
00:07:18,145 --> 00:07:20,145
Who I am is unimportant.

91
00:07:20,225 --> 00:07:22,825
What matters is that within three days,

92
00:07:22,905 --> 00:07:25,705
you hand over Qingzhou's garrison map.

93
00:07:27,185 --> 00:07:29,225
Otherwise, you wouldn't
want copies of this ledger

94
00:07:29,985 --> 00:07:32,025
on Meng Tinghui's desk, would you?

95
00:07:37,745 --> 00:07:39,545
The garrison map is a state secret.

96
00:07:40,545 --> 00:07:41,665
If I steal it for you,

97
00:07:42,505 --> 00:07:44,865
I will still die when the truth comes out.

98
00:07:44,945 --> 00:07:47,625
Do you think doing nothing will save you?

99
00:07:48,585 --> 00:07:51,065
Meng Tinghui will soon
trace it all to you.

100
00:07:51,585 --> 00:07:54,585
If you sit and wait, you will still die.

101
00:07:56,705 --> 00:07:58,105
If you cooperate,

102
00:07:58,585 --> 00:08:00,905
I can offer you a way out.

103
00:08:03,025 --> 00:08:04,265
What way?

104
00:08:07,145 --> 00:08:09,625
Help your prized student, Shen Zhili,

105
00:08:09,705 --> 00:08:10,745
become Empress.

106
00:08:11,345 --> 00:08:13,025
When a new reign begins,

107
00:08:13,105 --> 00:08:15,425
you will remain chief of the officials.

108
00:08:15,505 --> 00:08:16,425
And should disaster strike,

109
00:08:16,985 --> 00:08:19,345
she will be your best safeguard.

110
00:08:22,785 --> 00:08:23,945
If we're to cooperate,

111
00:08:24,745 --> 00:08:26,105
we should be honest with each other.

112
00:08:27,905 --> 00:08:29,865
I need to know who you are as well.

113
00:08:43,945 --> 00:08:44,785
You're back.

114
00:08:48,785 --> 00:08:49,865
You went to the Gu residence again.

115
00:08:50,945 --> 00:08:52,865
That is my business. It
has nothing to do with you.

116
00:08:53,585 --> 00:08:54,865
Between us,

117
00:08:54,945 --> 00:08:56,425
can we not even speak anymore?

118
00:08:58,625 --> 00:09:01,265
Ever since you learned
what the peachwood meant,

119
00:09:01,345 --> 00:09:02,585
you've been avoiding me.

120
00:09:03,305 --> 00:09:04,945
How long will you keep running from me?

121
00:09:08,945 --> 00:09:09,945
It isn't that we cannot speak.

122
00:09:10,865 --> 00:09:12,985
There are simply things
you should not say.

123
00:09:13,065 --> 00:09:15,345
Anian, you're still young.

124
00:09:15,425 --> 00:09:17,105
My feelings have nothing to do with age.

125
00:09:17,185 --> 00:09:19,305
When my whole family was gone but me,

126
00:09:20,505 --> 00:09:21,985
you used your handkerchief

127
00:09:22,065 --> 00:09:23,665
to bandage my injured palm.

128
00:09:23,745 --> 00:09:24,945
You told me mastering martial arts

129
00:09:25,025 --> 00:09:26,185
was the best way to honor them.

130
00:09:26,905 --> 00:09:27,825
It was also you

131
00:09:28,305 --> 00:09:30,505
who brought me close to
your parents and brother,

132
00:09:30,585 --> 00:09:32,465
and had me spar with His
Majesty and Huang Bo.

133
00:09:32,545 --> 00:09:34,585
You stayed beside me
through my darkest days.

134
00:09:35,225 --> 00:09:37,105
From then on, I swore

135
00:09:37,185 --> 00:09:38,785
I would grow up quickly and protect you.

136
00:09:41,625 --> 00:09:42,465
Anian.

137
00:09:43,025 --> 00:09:44,025
You've misunderstood.

138
00:09:44,905 --> 00:09:47,145
In my heart, you're a younger brother.

139
00:09:47,225 --> 00:09:48,345
I have misunderstood nothing.

140
00:09:49,305 --> 00:09:50,265
I know exactly what I feel.

141
00:09:51,065 --> 00:09:51,945
Besides,

142
00:09:52,025 --> 00:09:53,665
we share no blood relation.

143
00:09:55,105 --> 00:09:56,825
You call my parents Father and Mother,

144
00:09:56,905 --> 00:09:58,065
and Zhishu your brother.

145
00:09:58,785 --> 00:10:00,665
Is that not family affection?

146
00:10:00,745 --> 00:10:02,025
Wouldn't that make things easier?

147
00:10:03,225 --> 00:10:05,105
If we end up together someday,

148
00:10:05,185 --> 00:10:06,625
we won't even need to
change how we address them.

149
00:10:06,705 --> 00:10:08,305
Stop twisting my words.

150
00:10:09,105 --> 00:10:11,145
I'm older than you, so I am your sister.

151
00:10:11,225 --> 00:10:13,065
You're still young.

152
00:10:13,145 --> 00:10:14,745
Perhaps you cannot yet
tell what you truly feel.

153
00:10:14,825 --> 00:10:17,225
When you meet a better woman someday,

154
00:10:17,305 --> 00:10:18,785
you'll understand the difference.

155
00:10:22,505 --> 00:10:24,225
There is no woman better than you.

156
00:10:25,025 --> 00:10:26,185
Zhili.

157
00:10:26,265 --> 00:10:28,465
I have long known my own heart.

158
00:10:30,505 --> 00:10:31,585
But what about you?

159
00:10:32,545 --> 00:10:34,065
Can you truly tell what you feel for him?

160
00:10:37,065 --> 00:10:38,705
I know my own heart.

161
00:10:39,865 --> 00:10:41,345
I need no one else's judgment.

162
00:10:43,745 --> 00:10:45,065
So in your heart,

163
00:10:46,265 --> 00:10:47,665
compared with the Right Chancellor,

164
00:10:48,425 --> 00:10:49,825
I have become an outsider.

165
00:10:52,305 --> 00:10:54,625
I knew confessing to you today

166
00:10:54,705 --> 00:10:56,385
would create distance between us.

167
00:10:56,465 --> 00:10:57,545
But I do not regret it.

168
00:10:58,425 --> 00:10:59,745
I will wait as long as it takes.

169
00:11:00,305 --> 00:11:01,505
Even if it takes a lifetime,

170
00:11:02,345 --> 00:11:03,425
I will still wait.

171
00:11:05,185 --> 00:11:06,585
Calm down first.

172
00:11:07,225 --> 00:11:08,745
Don't let impulse ruin what we have.

173
00:11:08,825 --> 00:11:11,465
I left the peachwood in your room.

174
00:11:14,665 --> 00:11:16,025
I have made myself very clear.

175
00:11:16,105 --> 00:11:17,105
Don't…

176
00:11:18,745 --> 00:11:20,105
You like reading old laws and statutes.

177
00:11:21,105 --> 00:11:22,465
Whenever you go out,

178
00:11:22,545 --> 00:11:23,825
you always bring so many bamboo slips.

179
00:11:23,905 --> 00:11:25,785
I thought they were cumbersome to search,

180
00:11:25,865 --> 00:11:27,745
so I took the cases and statutes
you consult most often

181
00:11:27,825 --> 00:11:29,265
and recopied them all here.

182
00:11:29,985 --> 00:11:31,545
I made the writing larger,

183
00:11:31,625 --> 00:11:32,945
so when you read at night,

184
00:11:33,025 --> 00:11:34,025
you won't strain your eyes.

185
00:11:36,625 --> 00:11:37,865
You needn't feel burdened.

186
00:11:38,665 --> 00:11:40,225
I don't ask that you return my feelings.

187
00:11:41,065 --> 00:11:41,985
I only hope

188
00:11:42,865 --> 00:11:44,945
you can be with the one you truly love…

189
00:11:45,025 --> 00:11:46,185
side by side.

190
00:12:08,465 --> 00:12:09,945
Provisions are the lifeblood of an army.

191
00:12:10,025 --> 00:12:11,945
Pang Mu's negligence cost us the grain.

192
00:12:12,025 --> 00:12:12,865
Execute him at once.

193
00:12:12,945 --> 00:12:14,865
General Huo, Lord Shen,

194
00:12:14,945 --> 00:12:15,785
have mercy!

195
00:12:16,425 --> 00:12:17,505
Lord Shen.

196
00:12:17,585 --> 00:12:18,665
Although it was under Pang Mu's watch

197
00:12:18,745 --> 00:12:20,305
that the court's thirty thousand
shi of grain was lost,

198
00:12:20,385 --> 00:12:22,665
but the raiders were trained and fierce.

199
00:12:22,745 --> 00:12:23,825
His crime does not warrant death.

200
00:12:23,905 --> 00:12:24,945
Does not warrant death?

201
00:12:25,025 --> 00:12:26,865
Beijian cavalry is
barely a hundred li away.

202
00:12:26,945 --> 00:12:28,145
If they exploit this opening now,

203
00:12:28,225 --> 00:12:29,145
and our forces lack provisions,

204
00:12:29,225 --> 00:12:30,665
Qingzhou's defenses could fall.

205
00:12:30,745 --> 00:12:32,065
We need not wait for His
Majesty's punishment.

206
00:12:32,145 --> 00:12:33,865
You may all kill yourselves in apology.

207
00:12:33,945 --> 00:12:34,825
Take him away.

208
00:12:36,705 --> 00:12:37,545
General Huo.

209
00:12:37,625 --> 00:12:38,905
General Huo!

210
00:12:38,985 --> 00:12:40,425
Lord Shen!

211
00:12:40,505 --> 00:12:41,345
Lord Shen!

212
00:12:41,425 --> 00:12:43,345
Our priority is finding grain.

213
00:12:43,425 --> 00:12:44,585
I've sent an urgent report to court,

214
00:12:44,665 --> 00:12:45,865
but the allocation process is cumbersome.

215
00:12:45,945 --> 00:12:47,985
Distant aid may come too late.

216
00:12:48,065 --> 00:12:50,145
The granaries around Qingzhou

217
00:12:50,225 --> 00:12:51,905
can sustain us for only seven days.

218
00:12:54,025 --> 00:12:55,465
Have the troops hold out for seven days.

219
00:12:56,145 --> 00:12:57,185
As for the thirty thousand shi,

220
00:12:57,785 --> 00:12:58,665
I will find a way.

221
00:13:03,545 --> 00:13:04,385
Your Majesty.

222
00:13:05,585 --> 00:13:06,905
Your Majesty!

223
00:13:06,985 --> 00:13:07,985
My brother sent a letter.

224
00:13:12,625 --> 00:13:14,905
Your Majesty, I have infiltrated
the Blood Moon Society.

225
00:13:14,985 --> 00:13:16,105
My investigation shows

226
00:13:16,185 --> 00:13:17,985
its leader uses the alias Mr. Shangguan

227
00:13:18,065 --> 00:13:19,545
and is likely hiding in the capital.

228
00:13:19,625 --> 00:13:21,705
Zhongwan remnants are
entrenched in Qingzhou

229
00:13:21,785 --> 00:13:22,985
and are conspiring with Beijian,

230
00:13:23,065 --> 00:13:25,265
using the stolen grain
to provoke a border war.

231
00:13:25,345 --> 00:13:26,665
I have planted agents among them.

232
00:13:26,745 --> 00:13:28,265
But the military situation is urgent.

233
00:13:28,345 --> 00:13:29,945
Please prepare defenses at once.

234
00:13:30,025 --> 00:13:32,665
Beijian has long coveted
Qingzhou's iron mines.

235
00:13:32,745 --> 00:13:34,585
If the Zhongwan remnants
tempt them with that,

236
00:13:34,665 --> 00:13:36,745
Beijian may betray us

237
00:13:36,825 --> 00:13:37,665
and tear up the treaty.

238
00:13:37,745 --> 00:13:39,385
If Zhongwan and Beijian join forces,

239
00:13:40,065 --> 00:13:42,585
war may erupt along the border.

240
00:13:42,665 --> 00:13:44,145
Issue orders at once.

241
00:13:44,225 --> 00:13:45,905
Have the Ministry of War
send grain to Qingzhou,

242
00:13:45,985 --> 00:13:48,225
and secretly deploy Shazhou Camp elites.

243
00:13:48,305 --> 00:13:50,905
Have Zhishu find a chance to disrupt

244
00:13:50,985 --> 00:13:52,545
the Zhongwan-Beijian conspiracy.

245
00:13:52,625 --> 00:13:53,825
But remind him

246
00:13:53,905 --> 00:13:55,785
his own safety comes first.

247
00:13:56,465 --> 00:13:57,745
I'll see to it at once.

248
00:14:10,385 --> 00:14:11,985
Chairman Chen, rest assured.

249
00:14:12,065 --> 00:14:14,385
The contract will reach
Qingzhou within three days.

250
00:14:14,465 --> 00:14:15,465
As for Bofeng Tavern's branch,

251
00:14:15,545 --> 00:14:17,265
we'll split the profits
thirty-seventy as agreed.

252
00:14:17,345 --> 00:14:19,265
Manager Yan is certainly decisive.

253
00:14:19,345 --> 00:14:20,945
We will await the contract.

254
00:14:34,665 --> 00:14:35,905
Father.

255
00:14:35,985 --> 00:14:37,225
The wind and sand are heavy outside.

256
00:14:37,305 --> 00:14:38,625
Why did you come out?

257
00:14:39,345 --> 00:14:42,305
When you insisted on following
Meng Tinghui to the capital,

258
00:14:42,385 --> 00:14:44,985
I was so angry I smashed three tea sets.

259
00:14:45,505 --> 00:14:46,625
But now,

260
00:14:46,705 --> 00:14:47,985
following her has let you see

261
00:14:48,065 --> 00:14:49,825
a wider world.

262
00:14:50,545 --> 00:14:52,505
Watching you negotiate

263
00:14:52,585 --> 00:14:53,665
with trade guilds from every prefecture,

264
00:14:54,345 --> 00:14:57,225
even an old merchant like me is impressed.

265
00:14:59,785 --> 00:15:00,625
My daughter,

266
00:15:03,945 --> 00:15:05,545
you've grown up.

267
00:15:09,185 --> 00:15:10,025
Father.

268
00:15:11,505 --> 00:15:12,945
Before…

269
00:15:13,025 --> 00:15:15,145
you always opposed me appearing in public

270
00:15:15,225 --> 00:15:16,745
and opposed me doing business.

271
00:15:16,825 --> 00:15:19,505
This is the first time you've
praised Mengmeng and me.

272
00:15:21,625 --> 00:15:23,545
Since Ding Chong fell,

273
00:15:23,625 --> 00:15:25,865
I've watched Shazhou's merchant caravans

274
00:15:25,945 --> 00:15:27,465
increase by seventy percent.

275
00:15:27,545 --> 00:15:30,585
Not only is business easier for merchants,

276
00:15:30,665 --> 00:15:32,745
even poor households

277
00:15:32,825 --> 00:15:34,385
can now afford meat.

278
00:15:34,465 --> 00:15:36,065
This stubborn old stone of a heart

279
00:15:36,905 --> 00:15:39,785
has slowly been warmed by you two.

280
00:15:44,305 --> 00:15:45,425
Silly girl.

281
00:15:45,505 --> 00:15:46,865
All right, all right.

282
00:15:48,625 --> 00:15:49,585
You are now

283
00:15:49,665 --> 00:15:51,505
the head of the Yan family's business.

284
00:15:52,185 --> 00:15:54,425
You can't burst into tears so easily.

285
00:16:03,465 --> 00:16:04,705
Fuzhi.

286
00:16:04,785 --> 00:16:05,985
Zhishu.

287
00:16:06,785 --> 00:16:08,425
Master Yan, I came to see…

288
00:16:10,865 --> 00:16:11,705
Father-in-law.

289
00:16:13,625 --> 00:16:15,945
Do you really think I'm senile?

290
00:16:16,025 --> 00:16:18,945
This fake courtship act of yours—

291
00:16:19,025 --> 00:16:21,225
how long will you keep it up?

292
00:16:24,025 --> 00:16:25,425
Father.

293
00:16:25,505 --> 00:16:27,185
I had no choice.

294
00:16:27,265 --> 00:16:29,225
You deceived me first.

295
00:16:29,305 --> 00:16:31,105
I didn't mean to deceive you.

296
00:16:32,545 --> 00:16:33,385
Uncle Yan.

297
00:16:33,465 --> 00:16:34,825
This wasn't Fuzhi's fault.

298
00:16:34,905 --> 00:16:37,185
I was the one who said it on my own.

299
00:16:37,705 --> 00:16:39,265
If you must blame someone, blame me.

300
00:16:41,425 --> 00:16:42,705
Enough.

301
00:16:42,785 --> 00:16:44,105
I've thought it through now.

302
00:16:44,705 --> 00:16:45,945
I won't force you to marry.

303
00:16:46,025 --> 00:16:48,745
So stop putting on an act for me.

304
00:16:48,825 --> 00:16:49,665
Fuzhi.

305
00:16:49,745 --> 00:16:52,105
You are still a woman, after all.

306
00:16:52,185 --> 00:16:54,185
You cannot gamble with your reputation.

307
00:16:54,265 --> 00:16:56,385
You may be capable on your own,

308
00:16:56,465 --> 00:16:59,065
and you may earn mountains of gold,

309
00:16:59,145 --> 00:17:01,945
but I still hope someone will be there

310
00:17:02,025 --> 00:17:04,465
to care for you and cherish you.

311
00:17:07,825 --> 00:17:09,065
Uncle Yan.

312
00:17:09,145 --> 00:17:11,105
The act may have been false,
but my feelings are real.

313
00:17:11,705 --> 00:17:13,185
Fuzhi and I love each other.

314
00:17:13,985 --> 00:17:15,265
I will never fail her.

315
00:17:16,705 --> 00:17:18,385
Hearing that from you, Lord Shen,

316
00:17:18,465 --> 00:17:19,665
puts my heart at ease.

317
00:17:19,745 --> 00:17:21,865
You've come a long way as our guest.

318
00:17:21,945 --> 00:17:24,265
I'll have food and wine prepared for you.

319
00:17:25,305 --> 00:17:26,625
The military situation is urgent.

320
00:17:26,705 --> 00:17:27,985
I came to Fuzhi today

321
00:17:28,065 --> 00:17:29,105
to ask an important favor.

322
00:17:29,185 --> 00:17:31,305
Between us, why call it a favor?

323
00:17:33,825 --> 00:17:36,225
Fuzhi, this is a grave matter.

324
00:17:36,985 --> 00:17:39,105
Qingzhou Camp urgently needs
thirty thousand shi of grain.

325
00:17:39,185 --> 00:17:40,825
It must arrive within seven days.

326
00:17:41,585 --> 00:17:43,425
If we wait for court approval,

327
00:17:43,505 --> 00:17:45,305
the aid will come too late.

328
00:17:45,385 --> 00:17:47,065
I may run taverns,

329
00:17:47,905 --> 00:17:49,065
But within seven days,

330
00:17:49,145 --> 00:17:51,385
gathering thirty thousand shi
of grain may be…

331
00:17:53,145 --> 00:17:55,305
Father, I'm still new
to business in Shazhou.

332
00:17:55,385 --> 00:17:57,905
Could you help by acting as guarantor

333
00:17:57,985 --> 00:18:00,225
and buying private grain
from friendly merchants?

334
00:18:00,305 --> 00:18:02,265
-Even at a premium…
-Husband.

335
00:18:02,345 --> 00:18:03,185
Absolutely not.

336
00:18:04,745 --> 00:18:05,945
Thirty thousand shi of grain

337
00:18:06,025 --> 00:18:08,105
would empty our family coffers.

338
00:18:09,745 --> 00:18:11,145
The Shen family may be prestigious,

339
00:18:11,225 --> 00:18:12,785
but their annual stipend
is barely a hundred taels.

340
00:18:12,865 --> 00:18:14,505
The betrothal gifts haven't even arrived,

341
00:18:14,585 --> 00:18:16,585
and now our Yan family must pay instead?

342
00:18:16,665 --> 00:18:18,305
If Master Yan is willing to help,

343
00:18:18,385 --> 00:18:19,705
I can sign an IOU right now.

344
00:18:19,785 --> 00:18:21,065
I will repay every bit someday.

345
00:18:21,145 --> 00:18:22,065
Husband.

346
00:18:23,185 --> 00:18:25,625
Officials have two mouths:
one to borrow, one to deny.

347
00:18:25,705 --> 00:18:27,665
We've seen that before.

348
00:18:29,785 --> 00:18:32,105
Do you really want Fuzhi,

349
00:18:32,185 --> 00:18:34,425
or are you after our family's money?

350
00:18:34,505 --> 00:18:36,225
Just because you live and breathe money

351
00:18:36,305 --> 00:18:38,305
doesn't mean everyone else does.

352
00:18:38,385 --> 00:18:39,705
Husband.

353
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:42,025
I'm only thinking of our family.

354
00:18:42,105 --> 00:18:44,145
The Yan family's money

355
00:18:44,225 --> 00:18:45,505
doesn't fall from the sky.

356
00:18:45,585 --> 00:18:47,105
How can we throw it around like this?

357
00:18:50,145 --> 00:18:52,145
If Lord Shen is urgently gathering grain,

358
00:18:52,825 --> 00:18:55,345
could it be those Beijian wolves…?

359
00:18:57,265 --> 00:18:59,385
Master Yan, to tell you the truth,

360
00:19:00,225 --> 00:19:01,905
the situation is still unclear.

361
00:19:01,985 --> 00:19:03,025
War has not broken out,

362
00:19:03,105 --> 00:19:04,705
but we cannot let our guard down.

363
00:19:15,985 --> 00:19:18,345
If Lord Shen came in person,

364
00:19:18,425 --> 00:19:19,905
it must be extremely urgent

365
00:19:19,985 --> 00:19:21,985
and shows his trust in our Yan family.

366
00:19:22,065 --> 00:19:24,465
We may be merchants,

367
00:19:24,545 --> 00:19:26,625
but we understand duty to our country.

368
00:19:27,665 --> 00:19:28,505
Fuzhi.

369
00:19:29,145 --> 00:19:30,705
This is my seal.

370
00:19:30,785 --> 00:19:32,465
Every Yan family granary

371
00:19:32,545 --> 00:19:33,625
is at your disposal.

372
00:19:33,705 --> 00:19:34,865
If that is not enough,

373
00:19:34,945 --> 00:19:37,185
from today onward, every Yan shop

374
00:19:37,265 --> 00:19:38,905
will buy grain and sell no other goods.

375
00:19:38,985 --> 00:19:40,705
We'll also purchase private grain

376
00:19:40,785 --> 00:19:41,985
from the other major merchants.

377
00:19:44,145 --> 00:19:45,025
Thank you, Master Yan.

378
00:19:45,105 --> 00:19:46,185
I'll write the IOU at once.

379
00:19:46,905 --> 00:19:47,745
Lord Shen,

380
00:19:47,825 --> 00:19:48,905
do you take me

381
00:19:48,985 --> 00:19:51,105
for a merchant who cares only for profit?

382
00:19:51,185 --> 00:19:52,025
Husband.

383
00:19:52,105 --> 00:19:54,225
Even if you won't think of yourself,

384
00:19:54,905 --> 00:19:56,585
think of Song'er.

385
00:19:56,665 --> 00:19:58,745
If war truly breaks out,

386
00:19:58,825 --> 00:20:01,185
even thirty thousand
shi may not be enough.

387
00:20:01,265 --> 00:20:02,465
Then

388
00:20:02,545 --> 00:20:04,585
what good is a mere IOU?

389
00:20:04,665 --> 00:20:06,225
Merchants can only prosper

390
00:20:06,305 --> 00:20:07,865
in times of peace.

391
00:20:07,945 --> 00:20:09,745
Only because soldiers defend the realm

392
00:20:09,825 --> 00:20:12,305
can people like us live
in wealth and safety.

393
00:20:12,385 --> 00:20:14,345
You shortsighted woman,

394
00:20:15,105 --> 00:20:16,345
stop making trouble.

395
00:20:17,225 --> 00:20:18,265
Husband.

396
00:20:18,945 --> 00:20:20,265
Take Madam back inside.

397
00:20:21,585 --> 00:20:22,825
Madam, this way.

398
00:20:27,665 --> 00:20:28,825
Madam.

399
00:20:34,105 --> 00:20:35,465
Father, thank you.

400
00:20:37,025 --> 00:20:38,945
On behalf of the soldiers,
thank you, Fuzhi.

401
00:20:39,025 --> 00:20:40,025
Thank you, Master Yan.

402
00:20:40,105 --> 00:20:42,105
Silly daughter, worthy son-in-law,

403
00:20:42,185 --> 00:20:43,025
why be so formal with me?

404
00:20:43,105 --> 00:20:44,865
Come, get up.

405
00:20:48,665 --> 00:20:49,505
Fuzhi.

406
00:20:49,585 --> 00:20:51,985
I'll arrange the grain wagons at once.

407
00:20:52,065 --> 00:20:53,345
I still have urgent duties,

408
00:20:53,425 --> 00:20:54,265
so I cannot stay with you.

409
00:20:54,345 --> 00:20:55,625
Go take care of your work.

410
00:20:55,705 --> 00:20:56,745
As for the grain,

411
00:20:56,825 --> 00:20:57,945
I'll see it done.

412
00:21:01,185 --> 00:21:02,025
Shen Zhishu.

413
00:21:14,265 --> 00:21:15,345
Go on.

414
00:21:18,145 --> 00:21:19,785
Shen Zhishu, listen carefully.

415
00:21:19,865 --> 00:21:21,785
I'm famous in Shazhou
for loving handsome men.

416
00:21:21,865 --> 00:21:23,985
If you come back with even one new scar,

417
00:21:24,065 --> 00:21:25,825
I'll dump you.

418
00:21:25,905 --> 00:21:26,745
Then I'll find ten men

419
00:21:26,825 --> 00:21:28,305
even more handsome than you.

420
00:21:28,385 --> 00:21:29,225
That won't do.

421
00:21:31,225 --> 00:21:32,345
I already have three scars.

422
00:21:32,425 --> 00:21:33,705
My father left them when
he beat me as a child.

423
00:21:33,785 --> 00:21:35,025
You'd better inspect them first.

424
00:21:35,105 --> 00:21:36,345
Otherwise, when I return,

425
00:21:36,425 --> 00:21:37,705
I might get dumped for nothing.

426
00:21:38,505 --> 00:21:39,345
Here. Look.

427
00:21:39,425 --> 00:21:40,825
Shen Zhishu.

428
00:21:45,345 --> 00:21:46,345
All right.

429
00:21:47,505 --> 00:21:48,545
I was teasing you.

430
00:21:54,785 --> 00:21:56,585
What I mean is,

431
00:21:56,665 --> 00:21:58,705
come back safe and sound.

432
00:21:58,785 --> 00:22:00,065
Not even a hair may be missing.

433
00:22:02,585 --> 00:22:03,665
Do you hear me?

434
00:22:15,945 --> 00:22:16,945
Wait for me.

435
00:22:27,105 --> 00:22:27,945
I will.

436
00:22:39,785 --> 00:22:40,785
Your Majesty.

437
00:22:40,865 --> 00:22:43,025
Beijian's envoy has
submitted three state letters

438
00:22:43,105 --> 00:22:44,865
pressing us for an answer on the marriage.

439
00:22:45,345 --> 00:22:46,625
I…

440
00:22:46,705 --> 00:22:49,065
took the liberty of
consulting the ministers.

441
00:22:49,705 --> 00:22:52,305
We believe Shen Zhili,
daughter of Grand Tutor Shen,

442
00:22:52,385 --> 00:22:53,905
is both virtuous and talented,

443
00:22:53,985 --> 00:22:55,265
gracious and dignified,

444
00:22:55,345 --> 00:22:57,505
and worthy to serve as
a model for all women.

445
00:22:58,265 --> 00:23:01,065
I respectfully ask Your Majesty

446
00:23:01,145 --> 00:23:03,585
to appoint Shen Zhili as Empress.

447
00:23:03,665 --> 00:23:05,705
I second the motion.

448
00:23:08,465 --> 00:23:10,585
Your Majesty, I previously believed

449
00:23:10,665 --> 00:23:13,265
recommending Beijian's Divine
Maiden could secure the border.

450
00:23:13,345 --> 00:23:14,505
But after seeing the Left Chancellor

451
00:23:14,585 --> 00:23:15,825
so passionately favor resistance,

452
00:23:15,905 --> 00:23:17,425
I reconsidered the matter

453
00:23:17,505 --> 00:23:19,665
and found his reasoning sound.

454
00:23:19,745 --> 00:23:21,345
The Shen family is highly distinguished,

455
00:23:21,425 --> 00:23:22,945
a household steeped in
scholarship and propriety,

456
00:23:23,025 --> 00:23:24,625
renowned for its spotless reputation.

457
00:23:24,705 --> 00:23:26,385
She is indeed the finest
choice for Empress.

458
00:23:26,465 --> 00:23:28,945
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

459
00:23:32,225 --> 00:23:33,225
The two Chancellors

460
00:23:33,305 --> 00:23:35,705
are remarkably united today.

461
00:23:35,785 --> 00:23:36,785
Your Majesty, please judge wisely.

462
00:23:37,545 --> 00:23:40,825
The Right Chancellor and
I did disagree before.

463
00:23:40,905 --> 00:23:42,585
But our agreement today

464
00:23:42,665 --> 00:23:44,185
proves precisely

465
00:23:44,265 --> 00:23:46,265
that Miss Shen

466
00:23:46,345 --> 00:23:49,145
is the choice the court supports.

467
00:23:49,225 --> 00:23:50,705
The Left Chancellor is correct.

468
00:23:52,865 --> 00:23:55,745
I urge Your Majesty to
appoint an Empress soon

469
00:23:55,825 --> 00:23:56,745
to secure the state

470
00:23:56,825 --> 00:23:58,065
and continue the imperial line.

471
00:23:58,145 --> 00:23:59,545
You have all certainly…

472
00:23:59,625 --> 00:24:00,825
thought of everything for me.

473
00:24:01,745 --> 00:24:03,465
But I have always
respected the Shen family.

474
00:24:04,305 --> 00:24:07,105
Since you jointly recommend
Shen Zhili as Empress,

475
00:24:07,185 --> 00:24:08,385
shouldn't you first ask

476
00:24:08,465 --> 00:24:09,945
Grand Tutor Shen what he thinks?

477
00:24:10,025 --> 00:24:10,905
I

478
00:24:11,905 --> 00:24:14,025
feared Your Majesty
might have reservations,

479
00:24:14,585 --> 00:24:17,985
so I already asked Grand Tutor
Shen to co-sign the memorial.

480
00:24:22,745 --> 00:24:24,265
Your Majesty.

481
00:24:24,345 --> 00:24:27,025
The joint recommendation
has been submitted.

482
00:24:27,745 --> 00:24:29,985
I will order the Ministry of Rites

483
00:24:30,065 --> 00:24:32,505
to prepare the ancestral ceremony,

484
00:24:32,585 --> 00:24:35,625
and the Imperial Astronomical
Bureau to choose an auspicious date.

485
00:24:35,705 --> 00:24:37,705
Please issue the decree soon

486
00:24:38,385 --> 00:24:41,545
and announce the
Empress-designate to the realm.

487
00:24:44,345 --> 00:24:46,105
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

488
00:24:46,945 --> 00:24:48,825
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

489
00:24:49,465 --> 00:24:51,665
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

490
00:25:00,825 --> 00:25:03,185
Whatever happens at court,

491
00:25:03,265 --> 00:25:05,505
Grand Tutor Shen has
always stood behind me.

492
00:25:06,345 --> 00:25:07,465
Why this time…?

493
00:25:07,545 --> 00:25:08,705
I am doing this

494
00:25:09,305 --> 00:25:11,825
to end Beijian's ambitions,

495
00:25:11,905 --> 00:25:13,145
and also to end Your Majesty's

496
00:25:13,225 --> 00:25:15,625
improper hopes regarding Meng Tinghui.

497
00:25:16,385 --> 00:25:17,985
You may hide it from the whole realm,

498
00:25:18,065 --> 00:25:19,345
but you cannot hide it from me.

499
00:25:19,425 --> 00:25:21,585
When Your Majesty rewarded
Meng Tinghui before,

500
00:25:21,665 --> 00:25:23,065
I said nothing

501
00:25:23,145 --> 00:25:25,105
because I trusted Your Majesty's judgment.

502
00:25:25,185 --> 00:25:28,705
But Meng Tinghui's identity
as Zhongwan's princess

503
00:25:28,785 --> 00:25:31,065
means she can never be yours.

504
00:25:31,145 --> 00:25:33,385
After careful thought, only this

505
00:25:33,465 --> 00:25:36,385
can make Your Majesty
distance yourself from her.

506
00:25:36,465 --> 00:25:37,865
But Meng Tinghui

507
00:25:37,945 --> 00:25:40,705
knows nothing of her own origins.

508
00:25:40,785 --> 00:25:43,505
Even if the old Zhongwan
faction has plans for her,

509
00:25:43,585 --> 00:25:44,665
I will deal with them personally.

510
00:25:44,745 --> 00:25:46,385
I will never let her be dragged into it.

511
00:25:47,505 --> 00:25:50,105
Why must birth create such
an insurmountable divide?

512
00:25:50,185 --> 00:25:52,865
The Zhongwan remnants are
undeniably plotting restoration.

513
00:25:52,945 --> 00:25:55,305
If she learns the truth someday,

514
00:25:55,385 --> 00:25:57,585
faced with national and family hatred,

515
00:25:57,665 --> 00:25:59,505
who can predict what she will choose?

516
00:25:59,585 --> 00:26:01,105
For Daning's stability,

517
00:26:01,185 --> 00:26:03,225
I dare not rely on chance.

518
00:26:05,305 --> 00:26:08,745
The late Emperor granted the Shen
family the Royal Command Tally,

519
00:26:09,425 --> 00:26:11,985
giving me authority over life and death

520
00:26:12,065 --> 00:26:14,065
and bringing our family supreme honor.

521
00:26:14,145 --> 00:26:15,385
Today,

522
00:26:16,185 --> 00:26:18,825
With this tally, I implore Your Majesty

523
00:26:18,905 --> 00:26:21,145
to accept the Chancellors'
and ministers' recommendation

524
00:26:21,225 --> 00:26:24,585
-and appoint Zhili as Empress.
-Grand Tutor Shen.

525
00:26:27,705 --> 00:26:29,705
Even you would force me?

526
00:26:30,305 --> 00:26:33,505
The ministers all have
motives for promoting Zhili,

527
00:26:33,585 --> 00:26:34,905
but I promise this:

528
00:26:34,985 --> 00:26:37,665
the Shen family puts Your
Majesty and Daning first

529
00:26:37,745 --> 00:26:39,985
and will never be swayed by any faction.

530
00:26:40,065 --> 00:26:41,745
After weighing everything repeatedly,

531
00:26:41,825 --> 00:26:43,145
Zhili…

532
00:26:43,225 --> 00:26:46,425
is indeed the best choice for Empress.

533
00:26:47,865 --> 00:26:48,905
To avoid suspicion,

534
00:26:49,625 --> 00:26:51,905
once the imperial wedding is concluded,

535
00:26:53,145 --> 00:26:53,985
I

536
00:26:54,785 --> 00:26:57,745
will leave the capital with my wife
and withdraw from public affairs,

537
00:26:57,825 --> 00:26:59,505
retiring completely.

538
00:26:59,585 --> 00:27:01,625
Your Majesty, Director Meng
requests an audience.

539
00:27:05,105 --> 00:27:07,185
I, Shen Wuchen,

540
00:27:07,265 --> 00:27:10,225
implore Your Majesty to decide soon

541
00:27:10,305 --> 00:27:12,945
and stabilize the realm.

542
00:27:32,465 --> 00:27:33,465
Your Majesty.

543
00:27:33,545 --> 00:27:35,665
Left Chancellor Xu Ting and
Right Chancellor Gu Qin,

544
00:27:35,745 --> 00:27:37,945
along with the Six Ministries
and Nine Ministers,

545
00:27:38,025 --> 00:27:39,985
a total of 236 officials,

546
00:27:40,065 --> 00:27:41,105
have submitted a joint memorial

547
00:27:41,865 --> 00:27:43,545
recommending Zhili as Empress.

548
00:27:44,545 --> 00:27:47,865
Grand Tutor Shen even invoked
the late Emperor's Royal Command Tally

549
00:27:48,465 --> 00:27:50,985
asking Your Majesty, in seven days,
to go to Shengzu Hall

550
00:27:51,065 --> 00:27:52,865
and hold the ancestral ceremony.

551
00:27:52,945 --> 00:27:54,385
draft the enthronement decree,

552
00:27:55,105 --> 00:27:57,545
and proclaim it to the realm to
secure the imperial foundation

553
00:27:58,105 --> 00:27:59,625
and reassure the people.

554
00:28:01,865 --> 00:28:02,705
Fuzhi.

555
00:28:03,545 --> 00:28:05,425
When you returned from Shazhou last time,

556
00:28:05,505 --> 00:28:07,425
you asked whether I had
feelings for His Majesty.

557
00:28:08,825 --> 00:28:10,545
I hadn't understood my heart then

558
00:28:10,625 --> 00:28:11,745
and denied it in haste.

559
00:28:12,825 --> 00:28:14,145
But after facing death
together several times,

560
00:28:14,785 --> 00:28:16,865
His Majesty and I have
confessed our feelings.

561
00:28:17,625 --> 00:28:19,545
Because palace rules and
ancestral law forbid it,

562
00:28:20,385 --> 00:28:22,065
our love must remain hidden,

563
00:28:22,145 --> 00:28:23,905
yet it is fierce and overwhelming.

564
00:28:25,145 --> 00:28:26,545
And now, of all times,

565
00:28:26,625 --> 00:28:29,425
the entire court has
nominated Zhili as Empress.

566
00:28:30,225 --> 00:28:31,865
She is not merely my colleague,

567
00:28:31,945 --> 00:28:34,065
but a friend who has
risked her life beside me.

568
00:28:34,705 --> 00:28:37,305
Faced with open and hidden
attacks at court,

569
00:28:37,385 --> 00:28:38,385
I have never been afraid.

570
00:28:39,545 --> 00:28:41,305
But this situation

571
00:28:41,385 --> 00:28:44,065
has left me troubled for the first time.

572
00:28:45,265 --> 00:28:46,905
The feelings involved are so complicated

573
00:28:46,985 --> 00:28:48,265
that aside from you,

574
00:28:48,825 --> 00:28:50,745
I have no one I can tell.

575
00:29:13,305 --> 00:29:15,305
I hope the Left Chancellor will join me

576
00:29:15,945 --> 00:29:17,625
in recommending Shen Zhili as Empress.

577
00:29:17,705 --> 00:29:18,985
Everyone knows

578
00:29:19,065 --> 00:29:21,225
Shen Zhili is your prized student.

579
00:29:21,305 --> 00:29:23,905
Why should I help you
strengthen your power?

580
00:29:23,985 --> 00:29:26,625
Meng Tinghui's influence
at court is growing.

581
00:29:27,345 --> 00:29:29,305
Her supporters increase by the day,

582
00:29:29,385 --> 00:29:30,705
and she is close to the Shen family.

583
00:29:30,785 --> 00:29:31,785
She…

584
00:29:32,545 --> 00:29:34,265
is the greatest threat to both of us.

585
00:29:34,825 --> 00:29:36,545
If Grand Tutor Shen rallies the officials

586
00:29:36,625 --> 00:29:37,785
to recommend Meng Tinghui,

587
00:29:37,865 --> 00:29:40,145
and His Majesty gives his approval,

588
00:29:41,385 --> 00:29:42,225
then…

589
00:29:43,105 --> 00:29:44,705
neither of us can stop it.

590
00:29:45,825 --> 00:29:47,585
If we recommend Shen Zhili as Empress,

591
00:29:48,265 --> 00:29:51,105
we can end Meng Tinghui's hopes
of becoming Empress for good,

592
00:29:51,185 --> 00:29:53,385
and drive a wedge between
her and the Shen family.

593
00:29:53,465 --> 00:29:56,305
The Office of Public Inquiry
will inevitably be weakened.

594
00:29:56,385 --> 00:29:57,945
For both of us,

595
00:29:58,665 --> 00:30:00,905
there is everything to
gain and nothing to lose.

596
00:30:00,985 --> 00:30:02,745
Your only concern

597
00:30:02,825 --> 00:30:04,065
is that Shen Zhili is my student.

598
00:30:06,265 --> 00:30:07,905
But Grand Tutor Shen
heads the Shen family.

599
00:30:07,985 --> 00:30:09,265
Shen Zhishu and Di Nian

600
00:30:09,345 --> 00:30:10,825
are both His Majesty's trusted men.

601
00:30:10,905 --> 00:30:12,145
Which of them…

602
00:30:13,585 --> 00:30:15,385
can I truly control?

603
00:30:16,145 --> 00:30:17,625
The situation is clear now.

604
00:30:18,185 --> 00:30:19,345
It will be either Meng Tinghui

605
00:30:20,465 --> 00:30:21,385
or…

606
00:30:22,145 --> 00:30:23,465
Shen Zhili.

607
00:30:23,545 --> 00:30:25,105
Whom to support as Empress,

608
00:30:26,305 --> 00:30:28,265
I trust the Left Chancellor

609
00:30:28,705 --> 00:30:30,265
can weigh for himself.

610
00:31:00,225 --> 00:31:01,585
Leyan.

611
00:31:12,625 --> 00:31:13,585
Zhili.

612
00:31:22,225 --> 00:31:24,465
My name is indeed on the
Empress recommendation letter.

613
00:31:26,545 --> 00:31:27,705
I have nothing to say.

614
00:31:28,265 --> 00:31:29,185
Then…

615
00:31:30,065 --> 00:31:32,865
all those days of harmony between us,

616
00:31:32,945 --> 00:31:34,505
all those heart-to-heart talks

617
00:31:34,585 --> 00:31:36,625
and tender words…

618
00:31:37,945 --> 00:31:39,585
were they only an act

619
00:31:39,665 --> 00:31:41,145
and false affection?

620
00:31:41,665 --> 00:31:44,025
Not one bit of my feeling
for you was false.

621
00:31:46,265 --> 00:31:47,945
But the Left Chancellor and your father

622
00:31:48,025 --> 00:31:49,545
have united in recommending
you as Empress.

623
00:31:49,625 --> 00:31:51,265
The tide has already turned this way.

624
00:31:51,345 --> 00:31:53,385
I had no choice but to do it.

625
00:31:55,105 --> 00:31:56,865
Every one of you says you had no choice.

626
00:31:56,945 --> 00:31:58,705
Even my usually open-minded parents

627
00:31:58,785 --> 00:32:00,225
have completely changed this time.

628
00:32:02,225 --> 00:32:03,505
One avoids seeing me,

629
00:32:04,545 --> 00:32:05,985
and the other refuses to speak.

630
00:32:07,745 --> 00:32:09,385
You all say you love me,

631
00:32:10,425 --> 00:32:11,705
but in your eyes,

632
00:32:12,305 --> 00:32:13,425
am I nothing more than

633
00:32:13,505 --> 00:32:15,705
a puppet you can move however you please?

634
00:32:15,785 --> 00:32:17,505
Does my own will

635
00:32:17,585 --> 00:32:19,145
really mean

636
00:32:19,225 --> 00:32:21,985
so little to all of you?

637
00:32:25,185 --> 00:32:26,025
Leyan.

638
00:32:27,625 --> 00:32:28,945
I regret it deeply as well.

639
00:32:35,145 --> 00:32:36,705
Why don't I go to the palace now

640
00:32:36,785 --> 00:32:38,865
and confess our feelings to His Majesty?

641
00:32:39,505 --> 00:32:41,065
Even if His Majesty is enraged,

642
00:32:41,145 --> 00:32:43,465
I will bear every consequence myself.

643
00:32:43,545 --> 00:32:44,705
Even if I am torn to pieces,

644
00:32:45,465 --> 00:32:47,225
I will not let you suffer for it.

645
00:32:48,145 --> 00:32:49,145
Teacher…

646
00:32:53,465 --> 00:32:54,585
Teacher.

647
00:32:55,665 --> 00:32:57,465
You've had too much to drink.

648
00:32:57,545 --> 00:32:59,105
What exists between us

649
00:33:00,145 --> 00:33:01,985
will not be accepted by the world.

650
00:33:02,065 --> 00:33:04,025
If this becomes known,

651
00:33:05,665 --> 00:33:06,825
not only you and I,

652
00:33:08,425 --> 00:33:11,265
but my parents and the entire Shen clan

653
00:33:12,665 --> 00:33:14,785
will face condemnation and blame.

654
00:33:21,145 --> 00:33:23,225
Leyan, if you are willing,

655
00:33:25,585 --> 00:33:27,025
I will take you away right now.

656
00:33:29,265 --> 00:33:31,505
I don't care about office or reputation.

657
00:33:31,585 --> 00:33:33,225
I can abandon all of it.

658
00:33:33,305 --> 00:33:35,025
Even if I am reduced to a commoner,

659
00:33:35,105 --> 00:33:37,105
even if we live on plain food for life,

660
00:33:37,185 --> 00:33:38,705
as long as you are beside me,

661
00:33:38,785 --> 00:33:40,905
the wilderness will be our paradise,

662
00:33:41,505 --> 00:33:42,545
and a thatched cottage

663
00:33:43,185 --> 00:33:44,345
will be our home.

664
00:33:44,425 --> 00:33:45,705
Leyan.

665
00:33:47,105 --> 00:33:48,065
Trust me.

666
00:35:06,145 --> 00:35:07,425
Zhili.

667
00:35:07,505 --> 00:35:08,585
You finally came.

668
00:35:08,665 --> 00:35:10,105
I have something to tell you.

669
00:35:11,465 --> 00:35:12,305
Yin Qing and I

670
00:35:12,385 --> 00:35:14,065
have been investigating
the man behind Ling Yunfei.

671
00:35:14,145 --> 00:35:15,745
We did not mean to hide it from you.

672
00:35:15,825 --> 00:35:17,585
-We only didn't want…
-Director Meng.

673
00:35:18,385 --> 00:35:19,705
It doesn't matter anymore.

674
00:35:19,785 --> 00:35:21,545
I have already submitted

675
00:35:21,625 --> 00:35:23,185
my resignation to the
Ministry of Personnel.

676
00:35:23,785 --> 00:35:25,385
This one is for Director Meng.

677
00:35:26,105 --> 00:35:27,185
From today onward,

678
00:35:28,945 --> 00:35:31,265
we can no longer work together
at the Office of Public Inquiry.

679
00:35:36,065 --> 00:35:37,705
You worked so hard to enter government

680
00:35:37,785 --> 00:35:40,305
and earned so much merit at the Office.

681
00:35:40,385 --> 00:35:43,145
Will you really abandon it all?

682
00:35:45,745 --> 00:35:47,345
In the end, we are still women.

683
00:35:47,425 --> 00:35:48,385
Mengmeng.

684
00:35:49,025 --> 00:35:51,305
I'm not afraid of losing
my office or seal.

685
00:35:51,905 --> 00:35:52,785
I'm only afraid

686
00:35:53,905 --> 00:35:56,145
of being unable to be with the one I love.

687
00:35:57,305 --> 00:35:58,465
I don't understand.

688
00:35:59,105 --> 00:36:01,385
Why can the world not accept us?

689
00:36:02,265 --> 00:36:03,225
You mean…

690
00:36:03,745 --> 00:36:04,585
the Right Chancellor?

691
00:36:06,505 --> 00:36:07,985
We love each other.

692
00:36:09,025 --> 00:36:11,225
This is the first time in
my life I've loved someone.

693
00:36:11,305 --> 00:36:13,505
Even if it uses up all the
good fortune in my life,

694
00:36:13,585 --> 00:36:14,945
I do not want to give him up.

695
00:36:15,625 --> 00:36:17,225
What I came to tell you today

696
00:36:17,305 --> 00:36:18,465
is precisely about the Right Chancellor.

697
00:36:18,545 --> 00:36:19,385
Zhili.

698
00:36:20,065 --> 00:36:21,585
Commander Di.

699
00:36:21,665 --> 00:36:23,705
Tell Zhili what you know.

700
00:36:23,785 --> 00:36:25,265
He has been lying to you all along.

701
00:36:26,145 --> 00:36:28,665
Everyone says Madam Yuan died
protecting the Right Chancellor

702
00:36:28,745 --> 00:36:30,825
from a thief's attack.

703
00:36:30,905 --> 00:36:33,825
In truth, she died by the
Right Chancellor's hand.

704
00:36:34,345 --> 00:36:35,545
Anian.

705
00:36:35,625 --> 00:36:37,025
You're talking nonsense again.

706
00:36:37,785 --> 00:36:40,265
I saw Teacher's grief when
he lost his wife and child.

707
00:36:40,345 --> 00:36:41,585
Zhili…

708
00:36:41,665 --> 00:36:44,225
everything he has done was
part of the Empress scheme.

709
00:36:44,305 --> 00:36:46,145
If you truly become Empress,

710
00:36:46,225 --> 00:36:48,065
he is the one who benefits most.

711
00:36:48,145 --> 00:36:49,145
Impossible.

712
00:36:49,705 --> 00:36:51,665
-Teacher would never do such a thing.
-Zhili.

713
00:36:52,505 --> 00:36:54,305
Gu Qin does not deserve your devotion.

714
00:36:54,865 --> 00:36:55,745
Zhili.

715
00:36:55,825 --> 00:36:57,745
We have been gathering
evidence of his crimes.

716
00:36:57,825 --> 00:36:59,425
We're telling you first

717
00:36:59,505 --> 00:37:01,345
because we didn't want you
to hear it from someone else,

718
00:37:01,425 --> 00:37:03,465
and we didn't want you to be hurt.

719
00:37:03,545 --> 00:37:05,145
I know this is hard to accept,

720
00:37:05,225 --> 00:37:06,385
but it is the truth.

721
00:37:06,465 --> 00:37:09,145
Someone can prove all of it.

722
00:37:45,625 --> 00:37:47,145
The Qingzhou garrison map you wanted.

723
00:37:47,785 --> 00:37:48,945
Mr. Shangguan.

724
00:37:50,785 --> 00:37:53,065
The Right Chancellor is
well informed indeed.

725
00:37:53,145 --> 00:37:54,145
In only a few days,

726
00:37:54,225 --> 00:37:55,865
you discovered who I am.

727
00:37:57,465 --> 00:38:00,065
You killed Ling Yunfei with
the Infinity Pill.

728
00:38:00,905 --> 00:38:02,025
Do you think…

729
00:38:02,705 --> 00:38:04,465
you can stay hidden behind him forever?

730
00:38:05,545 --> 00:38:06,785
Between the two of us,

731
00:38:07,545 --> 00:38:09,985
who truly killed him?

732
00:38:13,905 --> 00:38:15,025
Enough idle talk.

733
00:38:16,225 --> 00:38:17,385
Where is what I asked for?

734
00:39:48,825 --> 00:39:51,065
It is time you showed your true face.

735
00:40:08,905 --> 00:40:10,785
Everything happened exactly
as His Majesty predicted.

736
00:40:10,865 --> 00:40:13,145
They really are after
Qingzhou's garrison map.

737
00:40:20,945 --> 00:40:23,585
The position of Empress
concerns the fate of the realm.

738
00:40:23,665 --> 00:40:24,865
At present,

739
00:40:24,945 --> 00:40:27,145
both Chancellors are pressing hard,
while Beijian watches like a wolf.

740
00:40:27,225 --> 00:40:30,265
Daning needs a stable inner palace.

741
00:40:30,345 --> 00:40:32,265
You are the most suitable choice.

742
00:40:32,345 --> 00:40:34,825
At the ancestral ceremony in seven days,
you will receive the phoenix seal.

743
00:40:34,905 --> 00:40:36,865
This is no longer a family matter,
but a matter of state.

744
00:40:36,945 --> 00:40:38,185
It is settled.

745
00:40:38,265 --> 00:40:40,985
Father, His Majesty and I are
only sovereign and subject.

746
00:40:41,065 --> 00:40:43,265
I cannot accept this phoenix seal.

747
00:40:43,345 --> 00:40:45,345
Besides, my heart already
belongs to someone.

748
00:40:46,185 --> 00:40:47,185
What did you say?

749
00:40:50,265 --> 00:40:52,905
Teacher and I love each other.

750
00:40:52,985 --> 00:40:53,825
Father, you would have me

751
00:40:53,905 --> 00:40:55,665
with my heart full of love for Teacher

752
00:40:55,745 --> 00:40:56,745
enter the inner palace as Empress.

753
00:40:56,825 --> 00:40:58,105
I cannot do that.

754
00:40:58,185 --> 00:41:00,825
It would mean deceiving His Majesty.

755
00:41:00,905 --> 00:41:02,745
For me, it would tear my heart apart.

756
00:41:03,945 --> 00:41:05,305
Say that again?

757
00:41:06,785 --> 00:41:09,265
Father, even if I say it
ten thousand times,

758
00:41:09,345 --> 00:41:11,465
I still want to be with Teacher.

759
00:41:11,545 --> 00:41:12,425
Our love is sincere and mutual.

760
00:41:12,505 --> 00:41:14,065
The Shen family has been
honorable for generations.

761
00:41:14,145 --> 00:41:15,185
We have built our name on integrity.

762
00:41:15,265 --> 00:41:16,905
I taught you the classics
and proper conduct

763
00:41:16,985 --> 00:41:20,105
not so you could defy human propriety.

764
00:41:20,185 --> 00:41:21,745
That fine teacher of yours—

765
00:41:21,825 --> 00:41:23,705
if he cared for you at all,

766
00:41:23,785 --> 00:41:26,065
how could he personally, at court,

767
00:41:26,145 --> 00:41:27,545
push you toward becoming Empress?

768
00:41:27,625 --> 00:41:29,465
Teacher must have his reasons.

769
00:41:29,545 --> 00:41:30,585
He said

770
00:41:30,665 --> 00:41:33,225
even if condemned by all
and beset by endless calamity,

771
00:41:33,305 --> 00:41:34,745
he would still grow old with me,
hand in hand.

772
00:41:34,825 --> 00:41:36,145
Come to your senses.

773
00:41:36,225 --> 00:41:37,305
Husband.

774
00:41:37,385 --> 00:41:38,385
Sister Zhili.

775
00:41:43,345 --> 00:41:44,385
In all my life,

776
00:41:46,585 --> 00:41:47,545
this is the first time Father…

777
00:41:48,505 --> 00:41:49,785
has ever hit me.

